`migrate` is the remedy the notice points at, so it never traverses its own gate: behind the same
marker that gates every other name, it renders.

The render is diverted to a file and left unasserted — it is shipped content whose text drifts. What
proves the gate did not fire is the vault log line, which is appended after the gate and only on the
render path.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- cmd --
booping render-playbook migrate --output out.md
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [render-playbook] migrate → out.md
